# Gemini CLI and Antigravity deltas
- Shared rules live in AGENTS.md and the files in .agents/rules/; do not copy them here.
- If .gemini/settings.json already loads AGENTS.md, this file is only a pointer.
- Run verification in the foreground; terminal policy is in .agents/rules/antigravity-permissions.md.
- Hook enforcement is not assumed on this platform; sandbox, approvals, and the CI brain check carry that load.
